		// Let's compute this using generating functions or DP
		// For exactly t others at a1 and rest < a1:
		// Choose t positions out of p-1, each gets a1, rest get < a1 and sum to rem - t*a1
		// But rem - t*a1 must be >= 0 and the rest p-1-t players must sum to rem - t*a1 with each < a1

